{"id":"c8b261132174a7d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-initial-segment.md","title":"ZFC Initial Segment","display":"df-zfc-initial-segment — ZFC Initial Segment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-initial-segment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-initial-segment"],"display":"df-zfc-initial-segment — ZFC Initial Segment","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-initial-segment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-initial-segment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-initial-segment — ZFC Initial Segment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,L,\\leq_L\\in V\">\\(I,L,\\leq_L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\\,\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(\\leq_L\\,\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S(I,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land I\\subseteq L\\land\n\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\to y\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S(I,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land I\\subseteq L\\land\n\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\to y\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is used as the declared binary relation object: downward closure is expressed by membership of ordered pairs in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\">\\(\\leq_L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,L,\\leq_L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_L\\,\\subseteq L\\times L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S(I,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land I\\subseteq L\\land\n\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in L\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\to y\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq_L","display":false}],"bytes":777,"backlinks":[{"id":"56ab03302c37e0c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ and $\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S$ are as in [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[./58-df-zfc-initial-segment.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-initial-segment.md|58-df-zfc-initial-segment]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":[]}